# 🎓 Student Hub Portal

A simple and user-friendly web portal designed to help students access important academic information and resources in one place.

## 📌 About the Project

**Student Hub Portal** is a frontend web development project created as a centralized platform for students.

The website provides different sections for student-related information, announcements, academic resources, and communication.

## ✨ Features

- 🏠 Home Page
- 👨‍🎓 About Page
- ⭐ Features Page
- 📢 Announcements
- 📞 Contact Page
- 🔐 Login Page
- ❓ FAQ Section
- 📱 Responsive Hamburger Menu
- 🌓 Light/Dark Theme Switcher
- 🔔 Interactive UI Components
- 📋 Student-friendly navigation

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Git
- GitHub

